cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this analysis code, please cite it as below, and cite the dataset it depends on (see references)."
title: "ecoTrace biogas-sensor pilot, Kiambu County, Kenya: installation and feasibility figure code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis and figure-generating code for the installation and feasibility
  pilot paper arising from the ecoTrace household-biogas monitoring pilot in
  Kiambu County, Kenya. Includes the publication figure scripts for the
  telemetry-completeness and daily use-rhythm figures, a script that
  reproduces every statistic the paper quotes, the graphical abstract, and the
  manually produced installation-site maps. The raw data and the derivation
  code live in the companion dataset (see references); this repository reads
  the derived data from it and does not duplicate it.
